🚀 Scalability & Performance Tuning
 ✅ How do you design auto-scaling policies for Spark clusters in AWS EMR or Kubernetes-based operators?
 ✅ How do you benchmark pipeline performance when dealing with 10TB+ data daily?
 ✅ Explain how you’d tune Kubernetes HPA/VPA for spiky ETL workloads.
 ✅ How do you handle connection pool exhaustion in high-concurrency APIs serving analytics queries?

🚀 Cloud-Native Security & Compliance
 ✅ What’s your approach to implementing network segmentation (service mesh / CNI policies) for sensitive ETL jobs?
 ✅ How would you ensure PII masking and encryption in CI/CD environments for data pipelines?
 ✅ How do you detect and prevent data exfiltration attempts in Kubernetes clusters?
 ✅ What security controls would you apply when using open-source connectors in production ETL flows?

🎯 Round 2 Status: Performance-driven & scenario-based, testing resilience, scale, and compliance.
